<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="http-run-shell">
  <title>Check your Node.js setup</title>
  <body>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='test {"testId":"http-run-shell","detectSteps":false}'/>
    <p>Print the Node.js version. The output starts with <codeph>v</codeph> and the major version:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node --version</codeblock>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"runShell":{"command":"node","args":["--version"],"stdio":"/^v\\d+\\./"}}'/>
    <p>Confirm that Node.js runs a script:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "console.log('ready')"</codeblock>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"runShell":"node -e \"console.log(&apos;ready&apos;)\""}'/>
    <p>A script that calls <codeph>process.exit(1)</codeph> exits with code <codeph>1</codeph>:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "process.exit(1)"</codeblock>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"runShell":{"command":"node -e \"process.exit(1)\"","shell":"bash","exitCodes":[1],"timeout":10000}}'/>
    <p>From the folder that holds this page, print the folder's name. The output matches the saved copy in <codeph>folder-name.txt</codeph>:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "console.log(require('path').basename(process.cwd()))"</codeblock>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"runShell":{"command":"node -e \"console.log(require(&apos;path&apos;).basename(process.cwd()))\"","workingDirectory":".","stdio":"http-run-shell","path":"folder-name.txt","maxVariation":0.1,"overwrite":"aboveVariation"}}'/>
    <p>Start a preview process, and wait until it prints <codeph>Preview ready</codeph>:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "console.log('Preview ready'); setInterval(() =&gt; {}, 1000)"</codeblock>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"runShell":{"command":"node -e \"console.log(&apos;Preview ready&apos;); setInterval(() => {}, 1000)\"","background":{"name":"http-shell-preview","waitUntil":{"stdio":"Preview ready","delayMs":250}},"timeout":15000}}'/>
    <p>Stop the preview process when you're done.</p>
    <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"closeSurface":"http-shell-preview"}'/>
    <data name="doc-detective" value="test end"/>
  </body>
</topic>
